utra jo aasman se mehzar wo shore-o-shin<br>
baitu-sharaf mein goonj uthe syeda ke bain<br>
farmate-the-habib-e-quda shah-e-mashraqain<br>
hussain-o-minni wana min-al-hussain<br>
<br>
1. karbobala mein mera pisar mara jayega<br>
pyaasa rahega boond na paani ki payega<br>
ansar-o-aqraba ki yeh laashey uthayega<br>
islam ko bachayega mera yeh noor-e-ain<br>
<br>
2. sar sab se aage naize par hoga hussain ka<br>
aur bhai be kafan to behan hogi berida<br>
darbar mein yazeed ke jayega qaafila<br>
zainab dayar-e-shaam banjayegi hussain<br>
<br>
3. hass kar sahega ye har ek ranjo malal ko<br>
jhule se leke jayega bano ke lal ko<br>
paani magar na dega koi nounehal ko<br>
pyasa hi mara jayega asghar sa noor-e-ain<br>
<br>
4. boli yeh sunke fatima zehra dohaayi hai<br>
farte alam se aanko mein tariki chayi hai<br>
baba qaber yeh aapne kaisi sunayi hai<br>
pata nahi hai mera dil-e-dard man chain<br>
<br>
5. phir sayyada ne poocha aye taaj-e-sir-e-yaqin<br>
kahiye abul hussain bhi to honge wahi khareeb<br>
main aur aap hongey kaha koi bhi nahi<br>
na main na tum na hongey ali fatahe hunain<br>
<br>
6. mohsin yeh sunke fatima zehra huvi malool<br>
rohal amee pukarey ke kehdi jiye rasool<br>
ek qaum qalq hogi ba andaaz bole phool<br>
ta-ba abad jo royegi kehkar hussain-hussain.